d 'GOOGLECHART': module to stata wrapper for the Google Charts (Visualization API)
d
d  library. Create a self-contained interactive HTML page,
d dashboard, or single embeddable iframe from any Stata dataset.
d Fourteen chart types: column, bar, line, area, combo, pie, donut,
d scatter, bubble, geo (country + US-state level), timeline, table
d (with built-in free-text search), histogram, divbar (Pew-style
d diverging stacked bar). Native filter dropdowns via Google
d Dashboard + ControlWrapper. Animation on most types. Optional
d Texas 2036 brand palette + Montserrat typography via tx2036style.
d Self-contained -- no external Stata package dependencies. The
d output HTML loads google.charts/loader.js from gstatic.com per
d Google ToS and therefore requires network access at view time. 
d
d KW: google charts; visualization; interactive; html; dashboard; choropleth; divbar; likert
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260730
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f googlechart.ado
f googlechart.sthlp
f googlechart_appendfile.ado
f googlechart_embedjs.ado
f googlechart_engine.sthlp
f googlechart_writehtml.ado
